 "result": "I documented 7 repos this run. I also refreshed the state for 11 more that had only scribe pushes or entries the developer already wrote.\n\nThe seven were ebutuoy-frontend, ebutuoy-backend, downfree-foundry, pajamastan-badge-tool, the agent test bed, flipcount-game and pajamastan-space-administration. The last two are new repos that were missing from repos.json, so I added them. Each got one docs commit pushed to main. All seven already had a root page or vercel.json, so no deploy fix was needed.\n\nI wrote release jobs for those seven. I also added release jobs for ordersim and stackloom-meta, whose changelogs the developer agents already wrote. The publish workflow still has to create all of these releases and set the descriptions and topics.\n\nThe profile README in sudosilo/sudosilo is rebuilt and pushed. State, repos, publish and the notes are committed to control-troll as \"scribe state\".\n\nNo backfills remain apart from the agent repos (control-troll, heckle-troll, sudosilo), empty repos and forks, which are skipped on purpose. I could not reach no repo. The private repo doctrine-duel-qx and its sandbox were absent from the repo list, so I left them alone.",
